0..73 Comment "// Equality derived from a data type\'s constructors (#2302): a definition"
74..145 Comment "// written `Eq.generic(T)` is structural equality over `T`, the checker"
146..217 Comment "// judging it as any declaration. Integers and strings compare by their"
218..297 Comment "// primitives, a sum by its side, a field of `T` itself recursively and a field"
298..375 Comment "// of another such type by that type\'s equality, written in place. A model of"
376..433 Comment "// `Eq` whose member is derived puts the type under `==`."
